sional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝微。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1531762,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":4774,"raw_end":4966,"raw_character_offsets":[4774,4775,4776,4777,4778,4779,4780,4781,4782,4783,4784,4785,4786,4787,4788,4789,4790,4791,4792,4793,4794,4795,4796,4797,4798,4799,4800,4801,4802,4803,4804,4805,4806,4807,4808,4809,4810,4811,4812,4813,4814,4815,4816,4817,4818,4819,4820,4821,4822,4823,4824,4825,4826,4827,4828,4829,4830,4831,4832,4833,4834,4835,4836,4837,4838,4839,4840,4841,4842,4843,4844,4845,4846,4847,4848,4849,4850,4851,4852,4853,4854,4855,4856,4857,4858,4859,4860,4861,4862,4863,4864,4865,4866,4867,4868,4869,4870,4871,4872,4873,4874,4875,4876,4877,4878,4879,4880,4881,4882,4883,4884,4885,4886,4887,4888,4889,4890,4891,4892,4893,4894,4895,4896,4897,4898,4899,4900,4901,4902,4903,4904,4905,4906,4907,4908,4909,4910,4911,4912,4913,4914,4915,4916,4917,4918,4919,4920,4921,4922,4923,4924,4925,4926,4927,4928,4929,4930,4931,4932,4933,4934,4935,4936,4937,4938,4939,4940,4941,4942,4943,4944,4945,4946,4947,4948,4949,4950,4951,4952,4953,4954,4955,4956,4957,4958,4959,4960,4961,4962,4963,4964,4965],"projection_sha256":"7d12d74f33f9156edd3f12064014d74a6b0d6a5d8b7f5c5771dd40ee460a3f8c","first_line":94,"last_line":94,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762"},{"text":"時西北遠邊有白題及滑國遣使由岷山道入貢，此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔注云：'白題，胡名也。'又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰方國使圖，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至於海表，凡二十國。子野與沛國劉顯、南陽劉之遴、陳郡殷芸、陳留阮孝緒、吳郡顧協、京兆韋棱皆博學，深相賞好，顯尤推重之。時吳平侯蕭勱、范陽張纘每討論墳籍，咸折衷於子野。","source_position":{"start":10762,"end":10954,"raw":"時西北遠邊有白題及滑國遣使由岷山道入貢，此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔注云：'白題，胡名也。'又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰方國使圖，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至於海表，凡二十國。子野與沛國劉顯、南陽劉之遴、陳郡殷芸、陳留阮孝緒、吳郡顧協、京兆韋棱皆博學，深相賞好，顯尤推重之。時吳平侯蕭勱、范陽張纘每討論墳籍，咸折衷於子野。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0038","start":38,"end":42,"surface":"漢潁陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"白題斬將的漢潁陰侯，梁030同一白題引古已用灌嬰身份，並保漢初潁陰侯的原稱；不是新授爵事件。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0044","start":44,"end":49,"surface":"白題將一人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"漢潁陰侯所斬一名未名胡將；個人可分而無名，保原稱未決，不據白題族名造具名人物。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"服虔","kind":"person","person_id":"rxm_wwu_6ns","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"白題胡名也的注者服虔，梁030同一引漢書注字句、同作者，不由單姓任配。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0065","start":65,"end":69,"surface":"漢定遠侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"引文不足唯一定位：保留未決候選，不配新人物。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"之","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"原文明示此稱謂，但本次不足唯一定位；保留未決，不新增臆測身份。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"劉顯","kind":"person","person_id":"mcd_vna_05k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"沛國劉顯與子野交好且推師道，梁030同地望、同交遊名列及顯推重短稱。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"劉之遴","kind":"person","person_id":"q7n_s7f_1cs","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"南陽劉之遴先在交遊列、後鴻臚卿觀移魏文，梁030同地望、同官、同文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"殷芸","kind":"person","person_id":"8d4_fth_d4l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"陳郡殷芸與子野賞好的博學名列，梁030同地望、同友人序列。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0140","start":140,"end":143,"surface":"阮孝緒","kind":"person","person_id":"372_tla_k26","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"陳留阮孝緒與子野博學賞好，梁030同地望、同友人列。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"顧協","kind":"person","person_id":"jc6_fqx_h6v","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"吳郡顧協與子野博學賞好，梁030同地望、同友人列。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"韋棱","kind":"person","person_id":"g1o_tw1_xj8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"京兆韋棱在劉顯至顧協的交遊人列末，梁030同地望、同人列與子野交遊脈絡。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0162","start":162,"end":163,"surface":"顯","kind":"person","person_id":"mcd_vna_05k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"沛國劉顯與子野交好且推師道，梁030同地望、同交遊名列及顯推重短稱。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0166","start":166,"end":167,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"蕭勱","kind":"person","person_id":"ik4_l58_n7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"吳平侯蕭勱與張纘折衷墳籍於子野，梁030同爵、同對談人物和文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"張纘","kind":"person","person_id":"wec_66y_sxi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"范陽張纘與吳平侯蕭勱討論墳籍於子野，梁030同地望、同伴及事件。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p019:m0189","start":189,"end":191,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"},{"text":"遷中書侍郎、鴻臚卿，領步兵校尉。子野在禁省十餘年，默靜自守，未嘗有所請謁。外家及中表貧乏，所得奉悉給之。無宅，借官地二畝，起茅屋數間，妻子恒苦饑寒，唯以教誨為本，子侄祗畏，若奉嚴君。劉顯常以師道推高之。末年深信釋教，終身飯麥食蔬。中大通二年卒。先是，子野自占死期不過庚戌歲，是年自省移疾，謂同官劉之亨曰：「吾其逝矣。」遺命務存儉約。武帝悼惜，為之流涕。贈散騎常侍，即日舉哀。先是，五等君及侍中以上乃有諡，及子野特以令望見嘉，賜諡貞子。","source_position":{"start":11217,"end":11441,"raw":"遷中書侍郎、鴻臚卿，領步兵校尉。子野在禁省十餘年，默靜自守，未嘗有所請謁。外家及中表貧乏，所得奉悉給之。無宅，借官地二畝，起茅屋數間，妻子恒苦饑寒，唯以教誨為本，子侄祗畏，若奉嚴君。劉顯常以師道推高之。末年深信釋教，終身飯麥食蔬。{{YL|中大通二年}}卒。先是，子野自占死期不過庚戌歲，是年自省移疾，謂同官劉之亨曰：「吾其逝矣。」遺命務存儉約。武帝悼惜，為之流涕。贈散騎常侍，即日舉哀。先是，五等君及侍中以上乃有諡，及子野特以令望見嘉，賜諡貞子。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"妻","kind":"person","person_id":"6bw_qsh_iqz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"只標妻字，與梁030子野無宅借官地、妻子常苦飢寒同一貧居記事；重用未名妻，妻子不合成一人、不分配子女生母。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"劉顯","kind":"person","person_id":"mcd_vna_05k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"沛國劉顯與子野交好且推師道，梁030同地望、同交遊名列及顯推重短稱。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0147","start":147,"end":150,"surface":"劉之亨","kind":"person","person_id":"r0m_ih0_odl","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"中大通二年子野移疾告同官劉之亨將逝，梁030同官關係、同臨終話。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0166","start":166,"end":168,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁天監起用、普通移魏文、中大通贈諡等子野朝事，梁030相同事稱高祖；不是齊永明武帝。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p022:m0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510","source":{"title":"梁書/卷30","revision_id":1508510,"revision_timestamp":"2018-10-23T11:04:54Z","status":200,"response_sha256":"a0c2fde0d659c9579a74194db70540c89ea4ff8160f8761aecdeeeec25530db4","raw_sha256":"930b640ef553931a6d0f2c2b8c548fbd69e0f0db12dd6637222764518d1b871f","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A2%81%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B730&oldid=1508510","api_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=query&format=json&formatversion=2&prop=revisions&rvprop=ids%7Ctimestamp%7Ccontent&rvslots=main&titles=%E6%A2%81%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B730","image_verified":false,